<title>JAPAN: Nissin Food says to buy up to 13.3 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Nissin Food says to buy up to 13.3 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissin Food Products Co Ltd said on Wednesday that it would buy up to 13.3 million of its own shares and change its company regulations to carry out the repurchase more swiftly.  </p>
<p>The decision needs to be approved by a shareholders' meeting on June 27, Nissin Food said.</p>
